 "l-1-5.q1": "Load average 12 on a 4-core machine, with high %wa. Which hypothesis is most likely?",
 "l-1-5.q1opts": "Lack of CPU only | Disk or network bottleneck causing processes to wait | Insufficient memory | DNS error",
 "l-1-5.q1exp": "In Linux, waiting for I/O counts towards load; high %wa points to storage or network as the bottleneck.",
 "l-1-5.q2": "What is the correct way to access a database on a private network?",
 "l-1-5.q2opts": "Expose the database port to the internet | Copy your private key to the bastion | Use ProxyJump/SSH tunnel through the bastion | Share a single key among the team",
 "l-1-5.q2exp": "Jumping through the bastion keeps the database private and preserves your private key on your machine.",
 "l-1-5.q3": "Disk with 40% free, but the application cannot create files. What to check?",
